he first equation, we have ${x}_{2}=0.$ \n\nSo, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}={x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{x}_{1}\\in R.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the required basis is \n\n$$\nB=\\{\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186459238 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "28511299-ebfb-5293-902f-101f1f26d032" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\{\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186458708} {:answer/id #uuid "380355e8-ec89-5a5a-9b8d-180e3d265520" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\{\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186458737} {:answer/id #uuid "a1ff38b2-c595-5523-9e2a-f1466dc97ca9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\{\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186458915} {:answer/id #uuid "d047e0d8-ef44-55a0-9397-3b87d3fe13a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\{\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186458989} {:answer/id #uuid "ecf99e7a-1cbe-5d4b-bfb0-64454434ab41" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\{\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459047}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\{\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186458915} :answer-field/id #uuid "e948ed0f-6cd4-5bcb-aebf-cf6c1f9ae9e7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459192}] :question/id #uuid "511be3f6-6670-5b38-85d8-5090c40ffd7e" :question/math-academy-id "q-96674" :question/problem "$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & 